 scx-scheds,
 pkexec,
 polkitd,
 systemd,
Description: switch sched_ext CPU schedulers
 A small Qt window and tray icon that shows which sched_ext scheduler is
 running, starts, stops or switches one through scx.service, picks a mode
 for it, and decides whether it starts at boot.
 .
 Changes go through one root helper run with pkexec. Nothing is enabled at
 boot unless the user asks for it.
